{"4568490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TurtleSkate", "steam_appid": 4568490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Comedy Horror with Turtles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TurtleSkate is a 1–5 player co-op comedy horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a turtle on a skateboard and run from strange entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/6d4231cb2142644cc7cfa2be65c56287.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/6d4231cb2142644cc7cfa2be65c56287.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/6d4231cb2142644cc7cfa2be65c56287.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Map and Escape Through Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the map, find keys, complete objectives, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the enemies will keep chasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/f7c1d21ed92efd8abe45f9fc71f77834.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/f7c1d21ed92efd8abe45f9fc71f77834.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/f7c1d21ed92efd8abe45f9fc71f77834.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intentional Discomfort: Fight the Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skateboard is fast, but difficult to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lose control and wipe out, get back up without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e057ac24f142c57730bd741829bfe84d.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e057ac24f142c57730bd741829bfe84d.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e057ac24f142c57730bd741829bfe84d.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turtle Face Cam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with your friends in real time and work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just stand in the corner and watch your friends die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e2e0fab4bfda29ae12fc982a69972207.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e2e0fab4bfda29ae12fc982a69972207.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e2e0fab4bfda29ae12fc982a69972207.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Friends Only:</strong> Random public matchmaking is not supported. You can only play with your Steam friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy Horror:</strong> Rather than serious survival horror, it is closer to chaotic and funny horror created by awkward controls and sudden situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Together:</strong> You can play solo, but it is much more fun with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum You Must Learn:</strong> The skateboard is fast, but not easy to control. Getting used to the charge-based controls is key to surviving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage-Based Progression:</strong> Each stage is cleared by pushing through its own unique objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive Your Friends:</strong> Bring back friends who have been reduced to nothing but their shells. You can also grab a friend's shell and run.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Comedy Horror with Turtles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TurtleSkate is a 1–5 player co-op comedy horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a turtle on a skateboard and run from strange entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/6d4231cb2142644cc7cfa2be65c56287.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/6d4231cb2142644cc7cfa2be65c56287.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/6d4231cb2142644cc7cfa2be65c56287.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Map and Escape Through Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the map, find keys, complete objectives, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the enemies will keep chasing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/f7c1d21ed92efd8abe45f9fc71f77834.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/f7c1d21ed92efd8abe45f9fc71f77834.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/f7c1d21ed92efd8abe45f9fc71f77834.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intentional Discomfort: Fight the Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skateboard is fast, but difficult to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you lose control and wipe out, get back up without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e057ac24f142c57730bd741829bfe84d.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e057ac24f142c57730bd741829bfe84d.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e057ac24f142c57730bd741829bfe84d.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turtle Face Cam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with your friends in real time and work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just stand in the corner and watch your friends die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e2e0fab4bfda29ae12fc982a69972207.poster.avif?t=1780816365\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e2e0fab4bfda29ae12fc982a69972207.webm?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/extras/e2e0fab4bfda29ae12fc982a69972207.mp4?t=1780816365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Friends Only:</strong> Random public matchmaking is not supported. You can only play with your Steam friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy Horror:</strong> Rather than serious survival horror, it is closer to chaotic and funny horror created by awkward controls and sudden situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Together:</strong> You can play solo, but it is much more fun with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum You Must Learn:</strong> The skateboard is fast, but not easy to control. Getting used to the charge-based controls is key to surviving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage-Based Progression:</strong> Each stage is cleared by pushing through its own unique objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revive Your Friends:</strong> Bring back friends who have been reduced to nothing but their shells. You can also grab a friend's shell and run.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Skate as a turtle, complete objectives, avoid entities, and escape. 1-5 player co-op horror.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Vietnamese, Spanish - Latin America, Indonesian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Thai, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568490/b805e8bc5277d330a212dcab53bb309dc312b972/header.jpg?t=1780816365", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati